      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "How fares the [Mysree Limestone Cave]\r\ninvestigation?\r\nI've no right to press, but...\r\nmake haste if you can.",
        "Jp" : "《ミスリウ鍾乳洞》の確認はどうかしら？\r\n急かせる立場ではないのだけれど\r\nできれば急いでちょうだい"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 286185,
