      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If that vicious Chimera, \r\nthe [Demonic Lion Singha] lies in wait... \r\nthe Knights sent to investigate...",
        "Jp" : "もしあの凶悪なキメラ《魔獅子シンガ》が\r\n潜んでいたとしたら――\r\n調査に行った騎士たちは――"
